          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 91 NW                PITSTONE              CHEDDINGTON ROAD 4/138                                         White Friars - GV                                            II House.  C15- early C16, altered 1600 and later.  Timber frame exposed in 2 left bays of N. front, remainder rebuilt in whitewashed brick.  Old tile roof, 2 intermediate brick chimneys.  One storey and attic, 4 bays with slight angle at centre, the left bay gabled to front.  Diamond leaded casements, mostly renewed C20.  Left bay of S. front has 3-light casements with segmental heads.  Second bay has 3-light casement below eaves, and door in lean-to tiled porch.  Right-hand bays have paired casements in gabled eaves-line dormers, and irregular ground floor windows with cambered heads.  Lower extension to right with 2 single lights.  Interior has cruck trusses flanking third bay, some other timber framing, and right bay with stop-chamfered joists and spine beam on bracket dated TBF 1600. Listing NGR: SP9363815818"
    }
  ],
